---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Teaching · Arnav Attri" description="Courses taught by Arnav Attri at Plaksha University and IIT Bombay." current="teaching">
  <h1>Teaching</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">
    About three years of teaching and research across <a href="https://plaksha.edu.in/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Plaksha University</a> and IIT Bombay.
  </p>

  <h2>Plaksha University · Teaching Fellow (Aug 2025 – Present)</h2>
  <p class="small muted">
    I run labs and tutorials for core CS and AI courses with classes of 80 to 112 students; design tutorials, labs, handouts, and assignments; draft question papers for quizzes, mid-sem and end-sem exams, finalised with faculty review and approval; manage Moodle, handle internship grading, and hold one-on-one doubt sessions.
  </p>

  <ul class="rows">
    <li>
      <div class="row-head">
        <span><strong>Introduction to Logic</strong> <span class="mono muted">CS2102</span></span>
        <span class="muted small tnum">Monsoon 2026–27</span>
      </div>
      <div class="small muted" style="margin-top:4px">
        Prof. Saeed Salehi · Sole Teaching Fellow. Designed tutorials independently, created assignments (approved by the professor), and handled grading end to end.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
